## Rewriting history without thinking about SHAs. `gfx` picks the commit to fix
## up interactively; `gabs` lets git-absorb find it from the diff itself, which
## is right far more often than a human guess. `gri` then squashes them.
alias gri='git rebase -i --autosquash'
